	(text_box "R6 changed to 10K and C2 added in series. R55 changed to 681 ohm to provide 1A charge current. D16 to RGB. Limit switches on board. Updated PMIC to include single button. Added notch filter to microphone. Changed pressure sensor to analog and added hardware safety to disable motor if pressure out of limits."
